		(uuid "00af66cc-a1ee-5732-af89-0174cc20862c")
	)
	(text "SSG: load 3.3k + YM in chip block; here 10u + 24k (A, C) / 47k (B) as MultiSound rev.A1.\nNARROW DIP ON: A -> right, C -> left through 82k (~30%). OFF: plain ABC.\nWidth: 100k ~25%, 82k ~30%, 68k ~35%. FM path DNP on the first board.\nGS 22k: PCM5102 full scale 2.1 Vrms -> ~1 V out; GS volume digital in RP-GS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "269c858d-02d8-5268-8a20-8356a95da2a1")
	)
	(text "ANALOG POWER (from +5V bus, no 12 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.348 36.705 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "29f897b2-7286-578f-99a0-861b83cedc61")
	)
	(text "MIXER INPUTS: SSG (MultiSound values) + NARROW STEREO DIP + FM (DNP) + GS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.694 36.3624 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2e8ba631-a026-5e8b-a6f2-fbf7c1ad8b5b")
	)
	(text "Op-amp: NJM4580 (or NE5532, same pinout) on +-5 V; inverting summer, Rf 10k || 470p (~34 kHz).\nOut: 100R -> 10u -> 47k bleeder -> jack (PJ307 like MultiSound; footprint to choose).\nKeep '-' input nodes short; LM2664/TPS60400 away from the summing nodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.91 349.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "398f2184-3012-5929-86ec-f21915278b35")
	)
	(text "Module jumpers: SCK -> GND, FLT / DEMP / FMT -> L (I2S, normal filter, no de-emphasis).\nXSMT jumper OPEN: driven by RP-GS (DAC_XSMT); 10k DNP pull-down = muted until RP is up.\nI2S: 33R series at the RP-GS end (RP-GS sheet). VIN from +5VA (module has its own LDOs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 278.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "804343f4-e4cf-551a-8537-38c1a4eee64a")
	)
	(text "TPS60400: Cfly 1u, Cin 2.2u, Cout 10u (datasheet); -5VA after RC 10R + 10u.\n+5VA_1 / +5VA_2 - one filter per YM (MultiSound Max idea, without 12 V).\nOp-amp decoupling: 100n at V+ and V- pins (mixer block)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.91 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
